<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Trang-1" id="2miyNCZCv7kLZ7YRbBC5">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1733" dy="960" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="4681" pageHeight="3300" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle DV02 — Development View: Proposed Package Organization\n\nleft to right direction\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam linetype ortho\nskinparam defaultFontName \&quot;Segoe UI\&quot;\nskinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8FAFC\nskinparam packageBorderColor #64748B\nskinparam ArrowColor #475569\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEB\nskinparam NoteBorderColor #D97706\n\npackage \&quot;Smart E-Mobility Hub\\nProposed source/package structure — MVP target\&quot; as System {\n    package \&quot;Presentation\&quot; as Presentation {\n        package \&quot;User Mobile Experience\\n(prototype view)\&quot; as UserUI\n        package \&quot;Operator Field Mobile Experience\\n(prototype view)\&quot; as OperatorMobileUI\n        package \&quot;Operator Web Dashboard Experience\\n(prototype view)\&quot; as OperatorWebUI\n        package \&quot;Shared Preview Shell\\n(existing mockup viewer)\&quot; as PreviewShell\n    }\n\n    package \&quot;API / Interface\&quot; as ApiLayer {\n        package \&quot;Express HTTP API\\n(target)\&quot; as HttpApi\n    }\n\n    package \&quot;Application\&quot; as ApplicationLayer {\n        package \&quot;Use-case Modules\&quot; as UseCaseModules {\n            package \&quot;Accounts &amp; Resources\&quot; as AccountsResources\n            package \&quot;Reservations &amp; Trips\&quot; as ReservationsTrips\n            package \&quot;Charging\&quot; as Charging\n            package \&quot;Operations\&quot; as Operations\n            package \&quot;Simulation\&quot; as Simulation\n        }\n\n        package \&quot;Application Ports\&quot; as ApplicationPorts {\n            package \&quot;Repository Ports\&quot; as RepositoryPorts\n            package \&quot;Notification Outbound Port\&quot; as NotificationOutput\n            package \&quot;Telemetry Input Contract\&quot; as TelemetryInput\n        }\n    }\n\n    package \&quot;Domain\&quot; as DomainLayer {\n        package \&quot;Accounts &amp; Resources Domain\&quot; as DomainAccountsResources\n        package \&quot;Reservations &amp; Trips Domain\&quot; as DomainReservationsTrips\n        package \&quot;Charging Domain\&quot; as DomainCharging\n        package \&quot;Operations Domain\&quot; as DomainOperations\n        package \&quot;Simulation Domain\&quot; as DomainSimulation\n    }\n\n    package \&quot;Infrastructure\&quot; as InfrastructureLayer {\n        package \&quot;SQLite Repository Adapter\\n(target)\&quot; as SqliteAdapter\n        package \&quot;Simulated Telemetry Adapter\\n(MVP option)\&quot; as SimulatedTelemetry\n        package \&quot;Mock Notification Adapter\\n(MVP option)\&quot; as MockNotification\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; Planned client-to-API dependencies; current mockups are not wired to this API.\nUserUI ..&gt; HttpApi : &lt;&lt;access&gt;&gt;\nOperatorMobileUI ..&gt; HttpApi : &lt;&lt;access&gt;&gt;\nOperatorWebUI ..&gt; HttpApi : &lt;&lt;access&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Aggregate dependencies keep the package view readable; module responsibilities and\n&#39; domain/UC mapping are detailed in the accompanying README.\nHttpApi ..&gt; UseCaseModules : &lt;&lt;access&gt;&gt;\nHttpApi ..&gt; TelemetryInput : &lt;&lt;access&gt;&gt;\nOperations ..&gt; TelemetryInput : &lt;&lt;access&gt;&gt;\nUseCaseModules ..&gt; DomainLayer : &lt;&lt;access&gt;&gt;\nUseCaseModules ..&gt; RepositoryPorts : &lt;&lt;access&gt;&gt;\nUseCaseModules ..&gt; NotificationOutput : &lt;&lt;access&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; These are source-package dependencies, not runtime calls or interface realizations.\nSqliteAdapter ..&gt; RepositoryPorts : &lt;&lt;access&gt;&gt;\nSimulatedTelemetry ..&gt; TelemetryInput : &lt;&lt;access&gt;&gt;\nMockNotification ..&gt; NotificationOutput : &lt;&lt;access&gt;&gt;\n\nnote bottom of System\n  This is a proposed logical package organization, not a claim about existing folders.\n  The backend packages form one modular monolith, not separately deployed services.\n  Presentation-to-API dependencies are planned; current UI is a mockup.\n  The Application owns the telemetry input contract; the API, Operations\n  and simulated telemetry packages depend on that source package.\n  Repository and notification abstractions belong to the Application boundary.\n  SQLite is a selected persistence technology, not a source package or deployment node.\n  Atomic allocation and state transitions need transaction boundaries.\n  Protocols, concrete libraries and production providers remain undecided.\nend note\n\n@enduml\n\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="1447xLcI5Li6DH4DxRwE-142">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
